    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>A recoil-absorbing stock and foregrip assembly that counteracts the muzzle climb and barrel drift caused by sustained automatic fire. The damper allows the shooter to maintain a tighter grouping during full-auto bursts without physical strength compensating for weapon movement. Designed for use with rifles and submachine guns. Grants a +1 item bonus to attack rolls made with automatic fire.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> - Install on weapon during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure. Requires a weapon with the automatic trait.</p><hr/><p><em>Installation: Drag it onto a weapon in your inventory to install it. It affects only that weapon. The +1 is added to this weapon's attack rolls when it fires automatic.</em></p>"
